CropDuster: Hey Newbie. \
Now that you've selected a class, you have now gained access to that class's unique arsenal.
CropDuster: On the right, you can see weapons that are currently available. Not much - but it is a start.
CropDuster: As you can see, the class's arsenal exhibits several different types of weapons. These are tailored to different combat style preference.
CropDuster: Also as you climb up the tower, you'll be able to unlock even more powerful versions of these starting weapons. You'll be a seasoned hunter in no time.
CropDuster: You can also track a locked weapon's recipe by click on the weapon and hitting the 'Track' button. You can then know where you stand as you acquire resources needed to craft that weapon.
CropDuster: Once a weapon is crafted, you will have it for good and can even swap it with another crafted weapon at any given time.
CropDuster: That's about it. Good luck, Newbie. I believe you'll do great things some day. May your bounty be plentiful!